{"id":"604f716378c63109","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modified-realizer-type.md","title":"算术片段的改良实现者类型","display":"df-modified-realizer-type — 算术片段的改良实现者类型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modified-realizer-type","aliases":["72-df-modified-realizer-type"],"display":"df-modified-realizer-type — 算术片段的改良实现者类型","depends_on":["[[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI Definition3.4, print431/PDF443; first-order arithmetic specialization","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"structural typing and source specialization checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"明确片段阶段并的自然数指标域"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modified-realizer-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modified-realizer-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modified-realizer-type — 算术片段的改良实现者类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"161f0473a5123eab\" href=\"?note=161f0473a5123eab\" title=\"72-df-realizer-finite-types\">72-df-realizer-finite-types</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI Definition3.4, print431/PDF443; first-order arithmetic specialization"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"structural typing and source specialization checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"明确片段阶段并的自然数指标域"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>数学对象语法取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a>，类型取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"161f0473a5123eab\" href=\"?note=161f0473a5123eab\" title=\"72-df-realizer-finite-types\">72-df-realizer-finite-types</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\">\\(t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_a\">\\(\\mathcal M_a\\)</span> 是下式给出的无析取算术片段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rt}\">\\(\\operatorname{rt}\\)</span> 按公式树递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_0&amp;:=\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\},\\\\\nM_{n+1}&amp;:=M_n\\cup\\{A\\land_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in M_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\forall_a x_i A,\\exists_a x_i A:A\\in M_n,i\\in\\omega\\},\\quad\\mathcal M_a:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega} M_n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(t=_a s)&amp;:=\\mathbf n,\\quad\\operatorname{rt}(\\bot_a):=\\mathbf n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(A\\land_a B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{rt}(A)\\times_r\\operatorname{rt}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(A\\to_a B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{rt}(A)\\Rightarrow_r\\operatorname{rt}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(\\forall_a x_i A)&amp;:=\\mathbf n\\Rightarrow_r\\operatorname{rt}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{rt}(\\exists_a x_i A):=\\mathbf n\\times_r\\operatorname{rt}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_0&amp;:=\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\},\\\\\nM_{n+1}&amp;:=M_n\\cup\\{A\\land_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in M_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\forall_a x_i A,\\exists_a x_i A:A\\in M_n,i\\in\\omega\\},\\quad\\mathcal M_a:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega} M_n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(t=_a s)&amp;:=\\mathbf n,\\quad\\operatorname{rt}(\\bot_a):=\\mathbf n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(A\\land_a B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{rt}(A)\\times_r\\operatorname{rt}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(A\\to_a B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{rt}(A)\\Rightarrow_r\\operatorname{rt}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(\\forall_a x_i A)&amp;:=\\mathbf n\\Rightarrow_r\\operatorname{rt}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{rt}(\\exists_a x_i A):=\\mathbf n\\times_r\\operatorname{rt}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只记录原书 Definition3.4 的一阶算术、无析取直接构造子片段；存在、全称、蕴涵均保留，不能叫作“负公式片段”。析取若要加入，须另给实现者标签及两个分支的类型，不能照搬数实现性的单一自然数签名。原子选数类型是来源明确采用的约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","status":"resolved","id":"161f0473a5123eab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数学对象语法取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，类型取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；$t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a$，$i\\in\\omega$。$\\mathcal M_a$ 是下式给出的无析取算术片段，$A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a$；$\\operatorname{rt}$ 按公式树递归。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","status":"resolved","id":"161f0473a5123eab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数学对象语法取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，类型取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；$t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a$，$i\\in\\omega$。$\\mathcal M_a$ 是下式给出的无析取算术片段，$A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a$；$\\operatorname{rt}$ 按公式树递归。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_a","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal M_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_0&:=\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\},\\\\\nM_{n+1}&:=M_n\\cup\\{A\\land_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in M_n\\}\\cup\n\\{\\forall_a x_i A,\\exists_a x_i A:A\\in M_n,i\\in\\omega\\},\\quad\\mathcal M_a:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega} M_n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(t=_a s)&:=\\mathbf n,\\quad\\operatorname{rt}(\\bot_a):=\\mathbf n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(A\\land_a B)&:=\\operatorname{rt}(A)\\times_r\\operatorname{rt}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(A\\to_a B)&:=\\operatorname{rt}(A)\\Rightarrow_r\\operatorname{rt}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rt}(\\forall_a x_i A)&:=\\mathbf n\\Rightarrow_r\\operatorname{rt}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{rt}(\\exists_a x_i A):=\\mathbf n\\times_r\\operatorname{rt}(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2242,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluati